SUMMARY:The Sound Within with Eisenberg and Stern
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:World-renowned vocal coaches\, voice practitioners\, and "gurus
  of the throat"\, Carol Eisenberg and Julie Stern host The Sound Within –
  an undeniably live musical journey that celebrates the miracle of the orga
 nic voice (and demystifies non-truths about the status quo in the entertain
 ment industry). Eisenberg and Stern have launched the careers of countless 
 musical artists – including Savvy&Jacqui\, The Almond Brothers and The Pl
 ain White Jeans – whom they invite on stage to perform chart-topping hits
  in this two-person musical character comedy.\nMore info: https://comedyatl
 as.app/comedy-atlas/event/the-sound-within-with-eisenberg-and-stern/
